$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=mvdvsin  LOC_AFTER=?

* The derivative of t |-> sin ( B t ) on RR (chain rule, dvmptco with dvsin).

s1::id |- ( B e. RR -> B e. RR )
s2:s1:recnd |- ( B e. RR -> B e. CC )
s3::simpr |- ( ( B e. RR /\ t e. RR ) -> t e. RR )
